---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Affiliate Disclosure | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="How affiliate links work on The Japan Desk." breadcrumbs={[{ name: 'Home', url: '/' }, { name: 'Affiliate Disclosure', url: '/affiliate-disclosure/' }]}>
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10">
    <article class="prose prose-slate max-w-none prose-headings:font-serif prose-a:text-accent-600">
      <h1>Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
      <p>The Japan Desk is a participant in affiliate programs, including but not limited to Amazon Associates, and networks such as ShareASale, Awin, CJ Affiliate, Impact and Travelpayouts, and direct partner programs including GetYourGuide and 12Go. When you click certain links on this site and make a purchase, I may earn a commission — <strong>at no additional cost to you</strong>.</p>
      <ul>
        <li>It does <strong>not</strong> cost you anything extra. Prices are the same whether or not you use my links.</li>
        <li>It does <strong>not</strong> mean a brand paid for a good review. No maker or shop pays to be included or ranked.</li>
        <li>My reviews are based on specifications, verified customer reviews, and Japanese-language primary sources. <strong>Where a review is research-based rather than hands-on physical testing, I state that clearly in the article.</strong></li>
      </ul>
      <p>As an Amazon Associate, I earn from qualifying purchases.</p>
      <p>Questions about how affiliate links work here? <a href="/contact/">Contact me</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
